'''Nyamusu''' (ニャームス Nyāmusu) is a [[:Category:Traitless Enemies|Traitless]] enemy that appears in the [[Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration Event]]. It was added in [[Version 4.7 Update|Version 4.7]].

{{Enemy Info
|name = Nyamusu
|appearance = [[Nebaaru-kun and Nyanpazuru Collaboration Event]]
|image = E 237.png
|money drop = 1,500円 - 5,925円
}}

==Enemy==
An enemy with rather high health, average damage and range as well as a high chance to freeze the players [[Cat Units]]. This enemy also has Area Attack making its freeze more deadly than it should be. In its debut stage she is at a very low magnification of 1%, making its initial stats pitifully lower than what they are in its second debut.

==Strategy==
Units that outrange this cat can help very much, as well as units that are [[:Category:Cats with Freeze Immunity|Cats with Freeze Immunity]] so that 75% proc chance will do absolutely nothing to them. However it's 8,000 will chip away your units health little by little no matter how high level they are.

